# [DD-13b.W23.1] A TAB-INDENTED `config` BODY IS REFUSED BY NAME.
# r57 grammar-lens PROBE CELL; §1.6.1a narrowing (4), TAKEN — this file is
# ACCEPTED at rc 0 on the pre-W23 binary, so this fixture IS the
# narrowing's regression rather than an assertion about something that
# never worked. Indentation is SPACES; a tab inside a VALUE is still data.
config dev
	flags i

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
